cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DiaryPipeline: a Microsoft Graph pipeline for collecting, reviewing and giving feedback on OneNote student diaries"
abstract: >-
  A teacher-facing web application that reads student diaries from OneNote
  Class Notebooks through the Microsoft Graph API, parses them into structured
  entries (deterministic or AI-assisted), stores reviewable snapshots in
  Firestore, and delivers teacher-approved feedback through Microsoft Teams,
  with export to CSV, XLSX and JSON.
authors:
